==Battleground==
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*3 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because every enemy here has the [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] trait, units like [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Solar Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] shine heavily here, as Castaway can permanently freeze the Aliens while Solar helps kill Nimoy Bore quicker. Having all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] makes this stage trivial, as their low magnification makes them a lot less of a threat.

